  (text "Single 10 mOhm 4-terminal shunt R201 sits in the cell negative lead, so it measures BOTH charge and discharge current. System GND = shunt ground side (star point)."
    (at 25 178.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 0b18150a-6887-4c1f-a727-7757a96699a5))
  (text "Kelvin sense: ISNS_N / ISNS_G from the shunt sense pins, SENSE_P / SENSE_N from separate wires at the cell tabs."
    (at 25 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 44772489-b48f-4e89-8f29-8e757eb54032))
  (text "K1 (charger) and K2 (load): 12 V automotive relays 30-40 A, normally open, in sockets (pins 85, 86, 30, 87)."
    (at 25 187.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid c37fb843-725d-41fe-a1a3-9b826bfa5fc5))
  (text "Interlock: Q203 holds K1 off while K2_EN is high, Q204 holds K2 off while K1_EN is high (both commanded = both off). Q205/Q206 drop both relays on FAULT."
    (at 25 191.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 0caf184c-a13c-4306-bc3d-fb96d48c1309))
  (text "R204/R207 pull-downs keep both relays off while the MCU boots."
    (at 25 196.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 6bf88eb4-07a6-46c6-9ca7-4876c5146234)))
